# Where new inquiries and species registers are announced.
#
# Any URL that accepts a JSON POST works — Slack and Discord incoming
# webhooks render the payload's `text` field directly; Zapier, Make, n8n
# and most CRM intake endpoints can branch on the structured fields
# (`event`, `id`, `email`, and either `specimen`/`availableSpace` or
# `requested`/`excluded`).
#
# Leave unset and submissions still save normally — the summary is logged
# to stdout instead. See docs/BACKEND.md.
ATELIER_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK=

# Where submitted records are written. Defaults to ./.data
# ATELIER_DATA_DIR=
